{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年61歲的1991年亞姐冠軍羅霖（Candy），保養功力向來驚人，被封為「凍齡美魔女」。日前羅霖現身深圳出席品牌活動，並於社交平台上載活動現場的精華短片，當日羅霖身穿一襲白色低胸吊帶高衩晚裝，身材修長纖細、皮膚緊緻，狀態極佳，完全看不出真實年齡！</p><figure><img alt=\"羅霖以大熱姿態奪冠。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953344707239612416860352.jpeg/fyOxWqsqgsF1hlewr7T-BJyIowS9vzwoIvdKSiL3Sko\"/><figcaption>羅霖以大熱姿態奪冠。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅霖以大熱姿態奪冠。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953344705108774912137824.jpeg/-CErCfZAsZyUixWqpkLIIsrYATrSoRAPUcy_sVHMv7E\"/><figcaption>羅霖以大熱姿態奪冠。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"凍齡功力驚人！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3254945/org/81f3f59ab5d720392307240db11b43df.jpg/Z1ZbNUtcB3DirW55aKwrOLVNc6yj3XbatXvEorV7xKI\"/><figcaption>凍齡功力驚人！</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"凍齡美魔女。（IG@candylolam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187461322582003712804675.jpeg/R1o1L6WfOdKR6iUIt73OdSADG0X5_ygZlPPG5pTzxuY\"/><figcaption>凍齡美魔女。（IG@candylolam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"凍齡美魔女。（IG@candylolam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187461320463749120529706.jpeg/yyqn5ZJa1l6Bi5-d-VY4ZdXJG2A9_3ueKsu66irLuuo\"/><figcaption>凍齡美魔女。（IG@candylolam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝生日。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187461472377245696693872.png/GwGKLDOxExywpK_9q_dVmoG-0PPXVGAPDAXHiAwFx4g\"/><figcaption>慶祝生日。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝生日。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187461469864726528014293.png/qKYB0gbOOEc0JMk06C-WQkFonojmE4ifHoIhOx6CITs\"/><figcaption>慶祝生日。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>61歲羅霖白色低胸高衩晚裝大騷美腿　感性發文：年齡從不是枷鎖</p><p>從羅霖分享的片段可見，她身穿白色吊帶低胸晚裝，裙襬特設高衩設計，隨着步伐隱約露出一雙修長美腿，紮起高馬尾的她神采飛揚，在台上親切地與主持人及現場嘉賓互動，盡顯優雅氣場。羅霖寫道：「年齡從不是枷鎖，抗衰的本質，不是對抗歲月，而是留住屬於自己的狀態與底氣。」網民紛紛留言大讚她凍齡功力驚人，完美詮釋了成熟女性的魅力與底氣！</p><figure><img alt=\"低胸高衩裙大騷長腿。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187455170884669440953270.jpeg/noiShOaM3t6rCrOSenICttD9pPVWXAl_z9DaL8_Q2i8\"/><figcaption>低胸高衩裙大騷長腿。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現身深圳出席活動。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187455168099520512716094.png/Mjk7ud2_KURi4Nk2vdFSynQRWfQi26mv-8sv__vLL_8\"/><figcaption>現身深圳出席活動。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現身深圳出席活動。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187455165415034880297356.png/ZcpwH47wH7Wqa6CS34IEqCzs_BszEX6e-Xt5a_l7eWs\"/><figcaption>現身深圳出席活動。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態大勇。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187455162780880896236518.png/AnjsqG6xobLf2wlmzJSrHOjMz6g0TTAz9ZiRmPWYkZg\"/><figcaption>狀態大勇。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態大勇。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187455159907651584495071.png/FWL6AMEOME1DFfoIHK4JayN4ukVyNIwR26QXuNukF7g\"/><figcaption>狀態大勇。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"明艷照人。（IG@candylolam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251018/1056304747847356416071293.jpeg/hRHVPD1sipOoig9H5mmTw5f9cJQHj9L1rbShwq20ocI\"/><figcaption>明艷照人。（IG@candylolam）</figcaption></figure><p>羅霖大方公開凍齡秘訣　投資6位數創自家美容品牌</p><p>羅霖年過60依然明艷照人，她曾在接受《香港01》訪問時大方公開凍齡秘訣，除了最基本的「清潔、防曬、保濕」三大鐵則外，她特別強調食療比塗抹更重要：「梗係要食下啲滋補品啦，飲多啲湯水呀！」她指出香港女生顯年輕，全賴愛喝湯的習慣，更親授平民保養法：「譬如話我哋一啲花膠，唔使買好靚好大隻嘅，買啲細細隻嘅用嚟煲湯呢，都會令皮膚有多啲膠原蛋白，全身都會靚囉！」除了花膠，她亦強調要多攝取優質蛋白質如雞蛋、雞胸和海鮮，真正做到由內靚到外。一向甚有美容心得的羅霖，更自爆決定與朋友合資創立自家美容品牌：「因為咁多年嚟好多朋友都會問我『你用咩護膚品呀？』咁我希望可以自己出一個同大家分享囉。」被問到投資金額，她透露非常穩陣：「因為我哋要試水溫㗎嘛，試下就六位數字先啦，六位中啦。」</p><figure><img alt=\"羅霖《Timeless凍齡美魔法》\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2956969/org/1519bbd870046c01727a24879ca1df04.JPG/NkEHtDRv_IunVzG8dk5n1i4UtTqbR5a80vu5MdL7uTE\"/><figcaption>羅霖《Timeless凍齡美魔法》</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅霖一向被封為圈中「美魔女」。（IG@candylolam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250504/995672738943209472526749.jpeg/bghLtwih_uNo1c0B3qJ-n2K5qhMCIGOZGMcu-BjHLvg\"/><figcaption>羅霖一向被封為圈中「美魔女」。（IG@candylolam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬白滑玉背。（IG@candylolam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241010/921112410839322624407925.jpeg/VoBGJzXwhZeThWP049mk_xtOXc3y3kv7Jbtq7iW7au4\"/><figcaption>大曬白滑玉背。（IG@candylolam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好Fit！（IG@candylolam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251018/1056303690006138880528761.jpeg/P9gvKXoMeVS4IHzAShnUye_3Zw9ADOlxmSkEf5kpBH8\"/><figcaption>好Fit！（IG@candylolam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"換上校服仍相當有睇頭。（IG@candylolam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036978285143527424751329.png/vEvaSuXcEl1Boh2Y_vu9QJek6Y3wrVDQGIO_DhiDvw4\"/><figcaption>換上校服仍相當有睇頭。（IG@candylolam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅霖與兩個兒子。（IG@candylolam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001818519106490368985361.jpeg/M13l1P9-ogGy978_gfSb3WVcq3opMd22gFegJYBXoCU\"/><figcaption>羅霖與兩個兒子。（IG@candylolam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅霖與朋友合資創立自家美容品牌。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260228/1104557073229680640486205.jpeg/LWJ5eoWpXlK9c48oTxRunAAxPk3LCaXYW4wftX6MH7U\"/><figcaption>羅霖與朋友合資創立自家美容品牌。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T04:19:37.749046+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1043,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:17:42.320538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T04:17:39.925838+00:00","content_hash":"abe90a0dd79f7e7f1026acd480d06851eced590a56bfb3c1e238ba9f9f2b0e77","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}